  "description": "Terrabit is a near-global collection of geospatial embedding vectors stored as Parquet files, with each record tied to a bounding box and tile identifiers. The assets include Clay v1.5 and LGND embeddings derived from Sentinel-2 imagery, the latter at 256-pixel chip size on a monthly basis. Further provenance and methodology are not documented.",
